class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udded <strong>Procedural runs</strong> \u2014 new layouts each descent, with consistent rules and timing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddb4 <strong>Fossils and progression</strong> \u2014 collect fossils, earn coins, and buy permanent upgrades.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Progress Beyond a Single Run</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780750/extras/f5de43dca2fe47f3b92f12208ce3cee8.poster.avif?t=1771629604\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780750/extras/f5de43dca2fe47f3b92f12208ce3cee8.webm?t=1771629604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780750/extras/f5de43dca2fe47f3b92f12208ce3cee8.mp4?t=1771629604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run helps you progress.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect fossils</strong> to complete museum collections.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completing fossils yields <strong>coin rewards</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend coins on <strong>permanent upgrades</strong> that improve future runs.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way you\u2019ll also learn monster patterns, timings, and safer routes\u2014each attempt makes the next one easier to read.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Every Action Has a Cost</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780750/extras/e8868deb9522c4e2f9544d3f30e6a421.poster.avif?t=1771629604\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780750/extras/e8868deb9522c4e2f9544d3f30e6a421.webm?t=1771629604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780750/extras/e8868deb9522c4e2f9544d3f30e6a421.mp4?t=1771629604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flarebound runs on one clear rule: <strong>time is the currency.</strong><br><br>Not turns\u2014<strong>time units</strong>, charged the instant you spend them.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monsters advance <strong>one tile per time unit</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lava creeps <strong>every two time units</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explosions move <strong>as fast as you do</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Digging costs more than walking, so every shortcut has a price.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even hitting a tile you can\u2019t dig through can waste valuable time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Learn the System\u2014or Your Run Ends Early</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780750/extras/6db43de01ee3b9eb8da1a09c0d766ca6.poster.avif?t=1771629604\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780750/extras/6db43de01ee3b9eb8da1a09c0d766ca6.webm?t=1771629604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780750/extras/6db43de01ee3b9eb8da1a09c0d766ca6.mp4?t=1771629604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s no reflex-driven combat and no randomness to bail you out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you die, it\u2019s fast and fair\u2014and you\u2019ll know exactly why.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flarebound rewards:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Situational awareness</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Route planning</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Knowing when <strong>not</strong> to dig</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Darkness Is a Threat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780750/extras/20d25848ae527f5831f38688c6a29014.poster.avif?t=1771629604\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780750/extras/20d25848ae527f5831f38688c6a29014.webm?t=1771629604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780750/extras/20d25848ae527f5831f38688c6a29014.mp4?t=1771629604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The caves aren\u2019t fully visible\u2014light is limited, and information is scarce.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Darkness isn\u2019t just mood. It limits what you can see and forces decisions with incomplete information.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time may stop when you do, but the darkness won\u2019t reveal what\u2019s ahead on its own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To see deeper and plan safely, you\u2019ll need to rely on <strong>flares</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Risk Is Optional. Rewards Are Not.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780750/extras/d12a1325950d7ac71605e930d36e327d.poster.avif?t=1771629604\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780750/extras/d12a1325950d7ac71605e930d36e327d.webm?t=1771629604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780750/extras/d12a1325950d7ac71605e930d36e327d.mp4?t=1771629604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The best loot usually isn\u2019t on the safest route. It\u2019s deeper down, where monsters are closer and mistakes cost more.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Taking detours means spending extra time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Going for rewards means pulling more danger toward you.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you push deeper for better upgrades, or play it safe and head back to the escape pod?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dig deep. Make smart choices. Be bound by the flare.</strong></p>","developers":["42 BYTES"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780750/9fad5be507770c8bea80b93f7a9e0b8d83e29478/header.jpg?t=1771629604","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Flarebound","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-7100 or AMD FX-6300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel UHD Graphics 620 / NVIDIA GT 1030 / AMD Radeon R7<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX compatible<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> Not supported<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes: